{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See if you have what it takes to survive in a society, the demo version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a group up to 4. Use voice or text chat to communicate with each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover several different society locales like the Park, Crossing the Street, School Hallways, the Library and More!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against the bizarre denizens like Consumers, Ducks, Giant Brains or the seemingly harmless Normie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect experience and money to use in the full version of Survive Society!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover different locations, items and relics. Log them in your Discoveries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Limits Compared to Full Game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Max limit of 3 locations per run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can't purchase cosmetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can't select or learn talents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Normal or Hard mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Curated selection of locations to visit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bottom text</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874730?t=1752861370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874730/d9e0d7531ce8a6a230b92c4f488c6b3bead98d75/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752861370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874730/680efb07d8ae9bc22c1c6afce5d03ea673b79443/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752861370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874730/680efb07d8ae9bc22c1c6afce5d03ea673b79443/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752861370","categories":[{"